<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>收尾 · 回到你自己的三道关</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>你那三道关里，有没有一道被绕过去了</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 33, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.45, textAlign: "center"}}>运行边界有没有开始限制你的真实交付？</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "stretch", marginTop: 30}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 24, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 19, color: "#0F6E56"}}>挡住了</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 23, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 10}}>认真评估换一条路</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 24, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 19, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)"}}>没挡住</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 23, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 10}}>先用好手上的</Text></Box></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 21, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 28, textAlign: "center"}}>判据不是「装了多少工具」——选型的输入是你们自己的边界，不是我的推荐。</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>35 / 37</Text></Box></Box>
